<text x="-297.7619125" y="609.70744375" size="4.318" layer="104">Layer Detail
16 Layer</text>
<text x="-251.039625" y="550.203371875" size="2.54" layer="104" rot="R90">70 mil diameter, 50 mil deep,
 controlled depth non-plated hole</text>
<rectangle x1="-261.976865625" y1="486.41" x2="-247.136915625" y2="548.3011625" layer="104"/>
<text x="239.0828375" y="601.30995" size="3.81" layer="104">FABRICTION NOTES:</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="588.268065625" size="3.81" layer="104">1)  Finished trace line widths should match
supplied gerber files (except where noted).</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="561.21808125" size="3.81" layer="104">3)  Copper weight;
Outer layers:  H oz finished weight
Inner layers:  1/2 oz</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="536.825190625" size="3.81" layer="104">4)  Top Solder mask: per IPC-SMA-840
X Liquid photoimageable
X Over bare copper
X Green</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="524.0248625" size="3.81" layer="104">5)  Bottom Solder mask: 
X None</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="510.982978125" size="3.81" layer="104">6)  Overall Board Thickness:
0.108 inches +/- 10%</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="498.423946875" size="3.81" layer="104">7)  Bare Board Electrical Test:
X Tested to Netlist Data</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="479.102675" size="3.81" layer="104">8)  Hole Diameter Tolerances:
Plated Holes:  +/- 3 mils
Non-plated Holes:  +/- 2 mils</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="454.70953125" size="3.81" layer="104">9)  Silk Screen:
Top:  White
Bottom: None
</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="442.5114375" size="3.81" layer="104">10)  Minimum annular rings:
Control most rings to minimum 2mil, 
small part of vias may have rings less than 2mil but no broken rings.</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="423.437559375" size="3.81" layer="104">11)  Plane registration: 
+/- 5 mils to top plane for all planes
</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="416.435796875" size="3.81" layer="104">12)  Minimum plating:
0.7 mil thick copper for thru holes; 0.4mil for blind vias</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="409.43403125" size="3.81" layer="104">13)  Fabricate in accordance with IPC-6012 Class 3</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="396.396465625" size="3.81" layer="104">14)  ENIG finish per IPC-4552</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="389.636003125" size="3.81" layer="104">15)  Warp &amp; Twist not to exceed 7 mils per inch across the diagonal</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="376.5984375" size="3.81" layer="104">16)  Acceptability: (per latest revision)
IPC-A-600</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="363.80216875" size="3.81" layer="104">17)  Manufacturer to add MFR's Logo, date code,
UL code and ET stamp.  Top Layer only.</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="351.247203125" size="3.81" layer="104">18) Vendor to supply cross sections and test
coupons per lot.</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="326.861934375" size="3.81" layer="104">19) Surface mount pads:
  Top Layer:  2928
  Bot Layer:        0
         Total:  2928</text>
<text x="239.0828375" y="580.539609375" size="3.81" layer="104">2)  Material:  mid-Tg (&gt;=150C) FR4</text>
<text x="-64.3135625" y="370.481609375" size="4.826" layer="104">NOTE:  32 Controlled Depth non-plated holes;
(50+/-5 mils depth and 50 mils diameter); 
2 holes for each connector; From top layer inward.</text>
<text x="-68.1235625" y="343.811609375" size="4.826" layer="104">NOTE:  2 Controlled Depth non-plated holes;
(50+/-5 mils depth and 70 mils diameter); From top layer inward.</text>
